  "question": {
    "text": "A small ball of mass $\\mathrm{m}$ starts at a point $\\mathrm{A}$ with speed $\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{o}}$ and moves along a frictionless track $\\mathrm{AB}$ as shown. The track $\\mathrm{BC}$ has coefficient of friction $\\mu$. The ball comes to stop at $\\mathrm{C}$ after travelling a distance $L$ which is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5CJ-N5FBB8GZscyiMqsZo5_M45_ZnyabImCqsL6W4mw.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "k2qZX",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2 \\mathrm{~h}}{\\mu}+\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{o}}^2}{2 \\mu \\mathrm{g}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "h9tIi",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mu}+\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_0^2}{2 \\mu \\mathrm{g}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "vV7YF",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{2 \\mu}+\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{o}}^2}{\\mu \\mathrm{g}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "UaDmr",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{2 \\mu}+\\frac{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{o}}^2}{2 \\mu \\mathrm{g}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Initial speed at point A, $u=v_0$\nSpeed at point $\\mathrm{B}, v=$ ?\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&v^2-u^2=2 g h \\\\\n&v^2=v_0^2+2 g h\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nLet ball travels distance ' $S$ ' before coming to rest\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&S=\\frac{v^2}{2 \\mu g}=\\frac{v_0^2+2 g h}{2 \\mu g} \\\\\n&=\\frac{v_0^2}{2 \\mu g}+\\frac{2 g h}{2 \\mu g}=\\frac{h}{\\mu}+\\frac{v_0^2}{2 \\mu g}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
